## Pets [/pets{?status}]

### List pets [GET]

+ Parameters
    + status (string, optional) - Filter by adoption status.
    + limit (number, optional) - Not in the URI template.

+ Response 200 (application/json)

        [{"id": 1, "name": "Rex"}]

